title: "A Targeted Nanopore Sequencing Pipeline for Tandem Gene Array Engineering"
abstract: "A shell-based pipeline for targeted Oxford Nanopore sequencing of tandem gene arrays: per-barcode alignment, target and flanking sequence extraction, coverage tracks, and optional normalization and dot-plot visualization."
